{"name": "Photography", "html": "<section class=\"mrspb-hero\" data-gsap=\"fade\" style=\"padding:120px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#18181b 0%,#3f3f46 100%);color:#fff;text-align:center;\"><div class=\"mrspb-container\" style=\"max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;\"><h1 data-gsap=\"slide-up\" style=\"font-size:48px;margin-bottom:20px;color:#fff;\">Capture Moments</h1><p data-gsap=\"slide-up\" style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:30px;opacity:.9;color:#fff;\">Professional photography for weddings, events and brands.</p><a href=\"#\" data-gsap=\"zoom-in\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 32px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">Get Started</a></div></section><section class=\"mrspb-section\" style=\"padding:80px 20px;background:#f8fafc;\"><div class=\"mrspb-container\" style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;\"><h2 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:36px;margin-bottom:50px;color:#0f172a;\">Selected Shots</h2><div class=\"mrspb-masonry\" style=\"columns:3 250px;column-gap:16px;\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;break-inside:avoid;\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;break-inside:avoid;\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;break-inside:avoid;\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;break-inside:avoid;\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;break-inside:avoid;\"></div></div></section><section class=\"mrspb-section\" style=\"padding:80px 20px;background:#fff;\"><div class=\"mrspb-container\" style=\"max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;\"><h2 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:36px;margin-bottom:50px;color:#0f172a;\">What clients say</h2><div class=\"mrspb-row\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:30px;\"><div class=\"mrspb-testimonial\" style=\"padding:40px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:18px;font-style:italic;color:#334155;margin-bottom:20px;\">\"The best page builder I have ever used.\"</p><h4 style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:600;\">Sara Ali</h4><p style=\"color:#64748b;\">Founder, Brandly</p></div><div class=\"mrspb-testimonial\" style=\"padding:40px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:18px;font-style:italic;color:#334155;margin-bottom:20px;\">\"Drag and drop makes building pages fun.\"</p><h4 style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:600;\">John Doe</h4><p style=\"color:#64748b;\">Marketing Lead</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mrspb-section\" style=\"padding:80px 20px;background:#f8fafc;\"><div class=\"mrspb-container\" style=\"max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;\"><h2 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:36px;margin-bottom:30px;color:#0f172a;\">Get in touch</h2><form class=\"mrspb-form\" data-form-id=\"contact\" style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:30px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><label style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:600;\">Name</label><input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" required style=\"width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:6px;\"></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><label style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:600;\">Email</label><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required style=\"width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:6px;\"></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\"><label style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:600;\">Message</label><textarea name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" required style=\"width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:6px;\"></textarea></div><button type=\"submit\" style=\"padding:12px 24px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;\">Send Message</button></form></div></section>", "css": ""}